    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's cool. so when you say they 'orchestrate a dance', does it ever get out of hand though? like is there a point where one side just takes over and ruins the whole batch? i'm worried about my starter dying or getting too sour to use.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
